    "long_instructions": "## Create an Image for a Healthy Meal\r\n\r\nYou're going to use an AI image tool to create an image of a healthy meal.\r\n\r\n1. Prompt the AI Chat for an image of a healthy meal.\r\n\r\n::: details [Example Prompt]\r\n\r\n>Generate an image of a healthy meal\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n2. Use the follow-up questions to make improvements.\r\n3. When you are satisfied, you can continue to the next level.",
